![Evolution X](https://github.com/Evolution-X-OnePlus-15/manifest/raw/bq2/Banner.png)

# Initialize local repository
```
repo init --no-shallow -u https://github.com/Evolution-X-OnePlus-15/manifest -b bka --git-lfs
```

# Sync up
```
repo sync -c -j12 --force-sync --no-clone-bundle --no-tags
```

# Set up the build environment
```bash
. build/envsetup.sh
```

# Setup priv-keys

- Setup priv-keys to pass DEVICE BASIC integrity
```bash
croot
```

```
cd vendor/evolution-priv/keys
```

```
./keys.sh
```

```
cd ~/evolution
```

# Start building

- Lunch a target
```bash
lunch lineage_infiniti-bp4a-userdebug
```

- To start compiling a clean build!!
```bash
sleep 500s; m evolution -j32
```

- To start compiling a dirty build
```bash
m evolution -j32
```

# Important: This manifest is adapted for Serverhive!!
